{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SpanEventDestination","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"SpanTracer","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"SpanTracer","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Tracer","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:7Tracing6TracerP"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview","anchor":"overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The span is found from the record’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":", which was taken when the event was"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracked, so a delivery that runs later, under another span or none, still adds the event to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the right one. Each span event is named after the event, stamped with the time it was tracked,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and carries the event’s description under "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"event"},{"type":"text","text":" and its call site under OpenTelemetry’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"code.*"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute names."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A record tracked outside any span, or whose span has ended by the time it is delivered, has no","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"span to join and is left out: span events can’t be added to a finished span. Batch tightly","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enough for spans to outlive their batches, or deliver to another destination as well.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage"